  "solution": "Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></semantics></math> là số đồng xu ở tầng thứ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>n</mi></semantics></math> (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℕ</mi><mo>*</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>).<br>Từ giả thiết, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là cấp số cộng với số hạng đầu <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>020</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và công sai <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>120</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Giả sử kim tự tháp có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>k</mi></semantics></math> tầng (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℕ</mi><mo>*</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>).<br>Khi đó, tổng số đồng xu xếp <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>k</mi></semantics></math> tầng là\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>020</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>120</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>60</mn><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3080</mn><mi>k</mi><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tTheo giả thiết, số đồng xu đã sử dụng là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>23</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>520</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên ta có phương trình\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>23</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>520</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mn>60</mn><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3080</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>23</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>520</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>42</mn></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">(nhận)</mtext></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>28</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">(loại)</mtext><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tVậy kim tự tháp có tất c